BV105CA.YAG, optimized Hy-Gain 105BA
28.000 28.400 29.000 28.500 MHz
5 elements, inches
           1.045    0.875    0.625    0.438 
  0.000    2.500   41.500   21.500   44.250 
 40.000    3.250   20.750   23.500   53.625 
 80.000    2.500   21.500   23.500   52.500 
169.500    2.500   21.500   23.500   50.500 
281.750    2.500   21.500   23.500   44.750 

The element taper is that of the Hy-Gain 105BA. 
Note that the 1.045" o.d. section is modeling
the element clamp and boom, and that the length 
of the 0.875" section is shortened by the length 
of the 1.045" section. 

This design was optimized for F/R over band > 20 dB,
and SWR over the band < 2:1, with a mid-band free-
space gain of 10.1 dBi. Torque compensator is 2.5" 
OD PVC, 30.5 " long, mounted 12" behind Director 3, 
on flat metal plate with U-bolts. 
